":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-23T11:53:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T16:49:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nVersion 4.4.1 (latest stable).\n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I enclosed the Menubar to MarginContainer and soon deleted the MarginContainer, the margins around the Menubar remains after deletion. I expected that deleting the MarginContainer, does undo what it did set. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n(1) Start with the minimal reproduction project:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/65867423-b379-4235-8674-29ec668f4db2)\n\n(2) Add MarginContainer like this:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7f623f6-5085-4291-9a7c-4c317befb9a3)\n\n(3) Select the MarginContainer and adjust its Theme Overrides / Constants / Margin top from 0 to 100.\n\n(4) Delete the MarginContainer, after moving the Menubar out of it.\n\n(5) At this point, the Menubar should still be 100 away from top.\n\nObserve that the MarginContainer has chanced Menubar's position value to 100. The fix is to change it back to 0. In my opinion, MarginContainer should not modify its children's values (in editor).\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mysheets-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19866695/mysheets-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105679/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}